    "commit": "f398d2cd",
    "summary": "ReviewJob core: one whole call when it fits the provider (or the budget is unknown), else MAP over context x symbol batches within the reserved budget; an unsplittable unit may use the hard budget (provider's whole input, or the size reported in a refusal). A size refusal re-plans symbols and context together and is never resent; a validation failure is retried as today (LLD: 'retried as today'), with the correction note only when the noted prompt still fits the hard budget. No atom is dropped; one over the hard budget raises AtomTooLargeError. packIntoBatches (t3) is unchanged."
